      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A nit to OP: *Age verified* instances don't exist as an option, and age verification is available to all VRChat users (ages 13+) to display that checkmark on their nameplate; a group permission for *age gated* (verified 18+) instances does exist, but must be allowed explicitly in group permissions (because this permission isn't set on by default). However, there's no way to enforce \"Age Gated (18+ Verified)\" instances upon creation with group roles (permissions) at the moment.\n\nAt the moment, certain groups (e.g. an unnamed group with > 17,000 members hosting tens of concurrent age-gated instances exclusively) rely on API scraping bots to close non-age gated instances every few minutes. This seems to work, but this isn't ideal to setup and has an external dependency on the bot.\n\nGroup audit logs also don't carry information whether an instance was created with age gating or not, which makes this difficult for groups to audit and enforce their requirements for \"only age gated instances\" group rules.\n\nI would like to see this feature request implemented for Age Gated (18+ Verified) instances.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
